      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳聽到我那段聲音大到已經不算是\n自言自語的火熱獨白了，對吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3807D5230621190A36BB5807297F3592752305DF27D934E0D7B97662F000A81EA8A0081EA8A9E7684706B71B17368767D4E86FF0C5C0D54273002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "其實是我正在煩惱\n我們餐廳的廚房火力不足。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n負責火力的小獅獅牠要是沒對戰，\n就一點都不肯燃燒起來。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51765BE6662F62116B635728716960F1000A6211501199105EF376845EDA623F706B529B4E0D8DB3300200100001BE01000A8CA08CAC706B529B76845C0F7345734572608981662F6C925C0D6230FF0C000A5C314E009EDE90FD4E0D80AF71C371D28D774F863002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了！\n為了讓我家的小獅獅燃起熊熊烈火，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳跟牠打一場火花四濺的寶可夢對戰吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C62DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86FF01000A70BA4E868B9362115BB676845C0F7345734571C38D77718A718A70C8706BFF0C00100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B38DDF726062534E005834706B82B156DB6FFA76845BF653EF59225C0D623054273002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以打一場火花四濺的寶可夢對戰的話，\n請來告訴我！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE562534E005834706B82B156DB6FFA76845BF653EF59225C0D623076848A71FF0C000A8ACB4F86544A8A346211FF01001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了讓我家的小獅獅燃起熊熊烈火，\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳跟牠打一場火花四濺的寶可夢對戰吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E868B9362115BB676845C0F7345734571C38D77718A718A70C8706BFF0C000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B38DDF726062534E005834706B82B156DB6FFA76845BF653EF59225C0D623054273002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "燃燒吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
