      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我說，小獅獅。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n都打了這麼一場對戰了，\n這下你也該能點燃真本事的火焰了吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118AAAFF0C5C0F73457345300200100001BE01000A90FD62534E8690199EBC4E0058345C0D62304E86FF0C000A90194E0B4F604E5F8A7280FD9EDE71C3771F672C4E8B7684706B71304E8654273002001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "烤烤噢！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70E470E45662FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就是說啊，小獅獅！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n想要認真地烤出烤排，\n就必須要拿出真本事才是！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C31662F8AAA554AFF0C5C0F73457345FF0100100001BE01000A60F389818A8D771F573070E451FA70E46392FF0C000A5C315FC59808898162FF51FA771F672C4E8B624D662FFF01001000020114013B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！這是我的一點心意。\n請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳用在灼傷的寶可夢身上。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
